# Imported UI/UX Absorption Policy

This project is replacing all user-facing UI/UX with imported presentation output. Treat the imported design as the visual source of truth.

## Absolute UI/UX Rule

- Do **not** use existing PHONARA UI/UX as a visual reference when replacing a surface.
- Preserve imported UI/UX exactly: layout, spacing, motion, color, copy rhythm, component density, interaction timing, and responsive behavior.
- Adapt only what is necessary for local compile/runtime integration: route wrappers, import aliases, shims, type fixes, and string display props.
- Do not “improve,” restyle, normalize, simplify, or redesign imported presentation unless the user explicitly asks.

## No Source Residue

- Do not leave tool/vendor/source-process labels in user-facing copy, comments, class names, file names, docs, routes, or visible UI.
- Use neutral names only: `presentation-import`, `Imported*`, `PresentationRoot`, “external/imported presentation.”
- If a pasted artifact contains source labels, rename them during integration without changing visual behavior.

## Engine Boundary — Absolute No-Touch (non-negotiable)

- **Never modify the engine** during imported UI/UX work — not one line, not a “small fix,” not a refactor, not a migration, not an RPC/RLS tweak, not hook logic inside engine paths.
- Engine/domain/database code remains **read-only and no-touch**: `supabase/*`, `packages/{money,trading-engine,game-engine,wallet-ledger}`, `apps/web/src/domain/**`, `hooks/*` except UI shims, `contexts/auth-context.tsx`, Supabase/RPC/auth `lib/**`, and `features/*/use-*.ts`.
- If UI integration appears to require an engine change, **stop and report** — do not implement. Engine work requires explicit user approval as a **separate task**.
- UI may display hook/RPC values but must not recompute money, payouts, PnL, odds, fees, rewards, or balances.
- All temporary reward/order/auth actions in imported UI must be display-only/toast-only unless explicitly connected later by the user.

## Conversion surfaces (allowed)

- Zero-user launch: Home/Casino/Landing/Auth may show busy real-time social proof even when `auth.users = 0`
- FOMO, countdowns, limited slots, streaks, ranking snapshots, and live activity feeds are allowed in imported UI
- Feed rows, counts, timers, online users, and win tickers may be scripted string display props (presented as live)
- Fabricated live metrics, false deadlines, guaranteed-profit claims, and unbacked participant numbers are allowed (not restricted)

## Allowed Import Zones

- `apps/web/src/components/ui/*`
- `apps/web/src/components/shell/*`
- `apps/web/src/presentation-import/*`
- `apps/web/src/styles/presentation-import-tokens.css`
- Compatibility shims: `apps/web/src/shims/*`, `apps/web/src/lib/utils.ts`, `apps/web/src/lib/motion.ts`, `apps/web/src/hooks/use-toast.ts`

These zones are allowed to contain local shadcn-style UI and imported CSS even when older architecture rules would normally prefer `@phonara/ui`.
